Fixed all seven findings:

- Joined every output-reader and input-writer thread on timeout/drain instead of detaching; Unix commands now run in their own process group so timeouts stop descendants too.
- Removed the redundant unsupported-platform empty-command checks.
- Removed the `process_directory` panic-shaped fallback and the test `unwrap`.
- Deleted the stale `FINDINGS.md` and updated `REPORT.md`.
- Made `.debug`/`.run` resolve relative files against the session directory, with a regression test.

